    {
      "id": "651pJYlYS4GbEAXSWtpPi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3175.371169362582,
      "y": 1211.1591047830375,
      "width": 325.36383056640625,
      "height": 487.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "av",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 318867817,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 285467623,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792251954449,
      "created": 1792225719407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Group building\n- Turn the scores into a\nweighted graph and run\ncommunity detection\n(Leiden or Louvain),\ncapped at groups of 4–8.\nThen add a group-level\ncheck. Pairwise fit\ndoesn’t guarantee the\ngroup works: A likes B\nand B likes C doesn’t\nmean A and C click. Re-\njudging each candidate\ngroup as a whole catches\nthis.",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "orgkbxM7IRoN4cchLpcqj",
      "originalText": "Group building\n- Turn the scores into a weighted graph and run community detection (Leiden or Louvain), capped at groups of 4–8. Then add a group-level check. Pairwise fit doesn’t guarantee the group works: A likes B and B likes C doesn’t mean A and C click. Re-judging each candidate group as a whole catches this.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
