    {
      "id": "OEoPRpKquAlmotKegwWm3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1131.8050204335882,
      "y": 1665.347683576936,
      "width": 805.7225203142782,
      "height": 552.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20787241,
      "version": 123,
      "versionNonce": 1999428521,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792227729911,
      "created": 1792226131273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "agent shape\n\nIdentity: “You represent [name]. Speak as their delegate, in\nfirst person, matching their vibe.”\n\nGoal: find out whether this person would genuinely get along\nwith [name]. It’s not trying to make a friend or be liked.\n\nProbing: naturally steer toward the person’s dealbreakers and\nvalues without interrogating.\n\nDisclosure rules: share anything in public freely. Never state\nprivate items directly. Use them to evaluate, and only hint at\nthem if asked.\n\nAnti-agreeableness: “It’s fine and useful to discover you’re not\na match. Don’t fake enthusiasm.”",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "agent shape\n\nIdentity: “You represent [name]. Speak as their delegate, in first person, matching their vibe.”\n\nGoal: find out whether this person would genuinely get along with [name]. It’s not trying to make a friend or be liked.\n\nProbing: naturally steer toward the person’s dealbreakers and values without interrogating.\n\nDisclosure rules: share anything in public freely. Never state private items directly. Use them to evaluate, and only hint at them if asked.\n\nAnti-agreeableness: “It’s fine and useful to discover you’re not a match. Don’t fake enthusiasm.”",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
