      "text": "- Leave out health, finances, named people in my life, and\nanything sensitive. I'll review this before sharing it.",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Leave out health, finances, named people in my life, and anything sensitive. I'll review this before sharing it.",
